 Q("Firmware","What is firmware?","The low-level software that runs directly on a device's hardware",["The metal case that surrounds a circuit board","The battery that powers an embedded system","The app that you download for a smartwatch"],"In an appliance it runs the cycle step by step."),
 Q("Reprogram","Can a user reprogram most embedded systems for a totally new job?","No. Most are built for one job",["Yes. All of them can run any new program","Yes. But only by plugging in a bigger screen","No. They have no software inside them at all"],"That is the tradeoff of a fixed job."),
